<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 88.09 mln rand SAfrican bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 88.09 mln rand SAfrican bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 88.09 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 400.98 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
